  '<p class="gd-p">You apply online in about ten minutes. We reply within one business day, set your terms, and walk you through the rest.</p><section class="gd-task" id="apply-and-get-your-car-listed-apply-to-list-your-car" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Apply to list your car</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Go to <span class="gd-url">carmacars.ca/list-your-car</span> and press <b class="gd-ui">Apply to list your car</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Start with your name, mobile and email, and your car: its VIN, or its year, make and model. Press <b class="gd-ui">Continue</b>. From here every answer is saved as you type.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">About you: individual or corporation, your address, licence and date of birth. Press <b class="gd-ui">Continue to vehicles</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">For each car, type the VIN: your car is found as you type the last character (Edit if anything is wrong), then tap its colour and answer the rest. Signed in? Press <b class="gd-ui">Take a photo</b> under Fill this from the ownership permit: the VIN, plate and colour fill in from a photo of your Ontario permit, for you to check. Use <b class="gd-ui">Add another vehicle</b> for more cars.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">Read how it will work, press <b class="gd-ui">Continue</b>, then <b class="gd-ui">Review</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">6</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Submit application</b>, then <b class="gd-ui">Go to your owner portal</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/list-your-car</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/800"><img src="/guides/img/public-13-list-your-car-desktop-48bf4cb0.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="800"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:20.1%;top:74.9%" aria-hidden="true">1</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>Need a break? Your answers are already saved. <b class="gd-ui">Email me a link</b> sends you a link to finish later, on any device. If you stop part way, we may email you a link to finish too.</div></aside><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>No car to add yet? On the vehicle step press <b class="gd-ui">I&#39;ll add my car later</b>, choose your password and press <b class="gd-ui">Open my owner account</b>. Your owner portal opens with <b class="gd-ui">Add your first car</b>: press it when you are ready, starting with the VIN.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="apply-and-get-your-car-listed-what-happens-next" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">What happens next</h2><p class="gd-p">Five steps take your car from your driveway to its first rental.</p><ol class="gd-flow"><li><b>1</b><span>Tell us about the car</span><em>We confirm fees and set your terms</em></li><li><b>2</b><span>Sign the agreements</span><em>Online, one for all your cars</em></li><li><b>3</b><span>One registry visit</span><em>We fill in the forms and come with you</em></li><li><b>4</b><span>Tracker and insurance</span><em>We install it and add the car</em></li><li><b>5</b><span>Photos and listing</span><em>Live within 1 business day</em></li></ol><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Right after you apply, Home shows <b class="gd-ui">Read your agreements</b>: both agreements, filled in from your application, marked &quot;Terms pending approval&quot;. The fees and the Revenue Share read Pending approval until we set them, and the Sign button stays off.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">When your terms are ready, Home shows <b class="gd-ui">Check and sign</b>. Everything is filled in from your application: check the short list of key values (each has a <b class="gd-ui">Fix</b> link) and open any document to read it in full.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Sign in a few steps: say you read the documents, initial the three confirmations, tick the two consents and draw your signature. Then press <b class="gd-ui">Sign all</b>. A code to your phone or email is optional (<b class="gd-ui">Verify by code</b>); it is asked first only if CarmaCars turns it on. One signature covers every document, in about two minutes.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Pay the upfront invoice: the first and last month&#39;s insurance fee for each car (see chapter 4).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">Upload what each car&#39;s checklist asks for: the ownership permit, the lender&#39;s permission if it is financed or leased, and insurance.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">6</span><div class="gd-t">Sign Forms C and D (filled in for you) with witnesses: Form C on screen with your witness beside you, or on paper; Form D on paper, with a photo of each page from your phone (see chapter 5).</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="apply-and-get-your-car-listed-if-we-need-a-little-more" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">If we need a little more</h2><p class="gd-p">Sometimes we need one more document before we can approve your application, for example the ownership permit or the insurance slip.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">You get an email, and Home shows &quot;We need a little more&quot; with the list and any note from our team.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Upload what is asked, or write Your answer, and press <b class="gd-ui">Send my answer</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">We review it within 1 business day. Once we approve your application, you get an email and Home shows Check and sign.</div></li></ol></div></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('admin', 'getting-around-admin', 'chapter', 'start-here', 'Admin opens on To do: the day''s counts at the top, then what needs you now, most urgent first. The menu groups every screen into seven groups: Today, Bookings, Cars, People, Marketing, Money and Settings. The long groups come in labelled parts (for example People: Owners and partners, then Renters, staff and investors). Search finds any booking, car or person, and Ctrl+K jumps to any page.

## To do

Start every shift here. Each line says what to do and why, and its button opens a small pop-up that does it, already filled in. Nothing to remember and no menu to search.

1. Each piece of work is its own line (work of one kind for several cars is one line, such as Add real photos (72 cars); its button opens the list), marked Now, Today or When you can: a car the insurer has not confirmed, a car not on the site, a renter''s documents to check, a visitor waiting in live chat, a booking request, a change a renter asked for, an owner application, an owner invoice waiting for payment, the first and last month an owner paid after their invoices were voided, the terms agreed with an owner still on the standard grid, documents an owner has not signed, an official form to check, a plate to check, a car showing sample photos, and any task of the Admin.
2. Press the line''s button: Mark insured, Set rates and publish, Review documents, Record payment, Record what they paid, Enter the terms, Record paper signature, Checked: use for owners, Open the chat, and so on. A line you do not need has Not needed or These are correct. The pop-up is filled in; check it and confirm. The line disappears once the work is done.
3. Under the lines, the counts with one button each (failed payments, agreements to countersign, tolls, listings, insurance, staff commissions, prices typed by hand, sales claims, Turo emails). A count with nothing waiting moves to the bottom, under "more with nothing waiting".
4. While no assistant holds customer service, sales, finance or fleet (the live verification''s test accounts do not count), their tasks come to To do too, and so do their emails, to rent@carmacars.ca.
5. Beside the list (under it on a phone): today''s pickups (ready or not ready), today''s returns (due or late) and today''s chauffeur bookings, by time.
6. Press **Overview** for the money, fleet and queue figures, the alerts and the team''s sales for the month.
7. The dark band at the top counts the day, each count one tap from its page: requests waiting (with how long the oldest has waited, red past the reply target), pickups and returns today, payments to chase, deposits to settle, staff tasks open and alerts. A count that needs you now is red and says so.

![](/guides/img/admin-01-today-desktop-ea48309c.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 900; address: carmacars.ca/admin; pins: 1 22.9 65.0, 2 61.8 65.6, 5 76.4 56.1, 6 84.4 24.7, 7 58.3 37.8")

## The menu

The current group is open, with its pages; press another group to open it. On a phone the whole menu sits behind one Menu button that says where you are.

| Group | Pages |
| --- | --- |
| Today | To do, Overview, Staff tasks, Live visitors |
| Bookings | Trips: Bookings (Now and All bookings), Requests and offers (with Chauffeur), Calendar. Customers: Live chat, Renter leads, Reviews. Problems: Damage, Incidents and claims |
| Cars | Vehicles, Listings, Maintenance, Rates for many cars, Calendar sync, Similar cars, Retire or delete |
| Money | Owners: Owner invoices, Owner debits, Owner statements, Payouts. Renters: Payments by day, Payments and refunds, Tolls and tickets. Company: Company statements, Reconciliation, Expenses, Insurer rates, Insurer invoices, Staff commissions, Field pay |
| People | Owners and partners: Applications, Owners, Add a car for an owner, Partners, Owner forms, Paid and signed. Renters, staff and investors: Renters, Staff, Investors, Portals and view as |
| Marketing | Ads: Listings, Posted ads, Social drafts. Results: Bookings by channel. Owners: Owner recruitment |
| Settings | All settings. Website: Site, Vehicle pages, Sample photos, Add-ons, Discount games, Guides. Rules: Program, Forms, Maintenance, Emails. Records: Email log, Audit log |

![On a phone: press Menu (1), then a group (2), then the page (3).](/guides/img/admin-31-menu-phone-667dc2fd.jpg "phone; size: 390 715; pins: 1 10.3 28.7, 2 76.9 42.4, 3 76.9 48.3")

## Search

The search box sits at the top of the menu, on every page.

1. Type a booking number (CC-1042), a car code (CC-7F3A, on every car page and fleet card), a plate, a VIN, or a name or email address.
2. Press **Search** (or Enter). Results come in groups: bookings, cars, owners, partners and renters. Open one to go to its page.
3. To go to a page instead, press Ctrl+K (Cmd+K on a Mac) or **Jump to a page** under the search box, type a few letters (Payouts, Program settings) and press Enter. The first line searches the records for what you typed.

![](/guides/img/admin-32-search-desktop-ca548a70.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 420; address: carmacars.ca/admin/search?q=CC-10065; pins: 1 7.4 45.2, 2 95.0 46.9")

## Keyboard shortcuts

Press g, then a letter. Press / to jump to the search box, and Ctrl+K to jump to any page.

| Keys | Opens | Keys | Opens |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| g t | To do | g v | Vehicles |
| g r | Requests | g l | Listings |
| g b | Bookings | g a | Applications |
| g c | Calendar | g o | Owners |
| g k | Staff tasks | g m | Payments and refunds |
| g s | All settings | / | Search |
| Ctrl K | Jump to a page | Esc | Close it |
